  "进行体加起始体，表示正在发生的动作是新情况，可用于寒暄。": "Progressive plus inchoative: the ongoing action is a new situation. This can be used as a greeting.",
  "持续体，强调状态的保持。": "Durative: emphasis on maintaining the state.",
  "持续体加祈使态（IMP）。祈使语气在句子层面标注，不给box另加一个祈使词义。": "Durative plus imperative (IMP). Imperative mood belongs to the clause as a whole; box retains its durative function.",
