  "说明：原文首段写有“CJ tones in parentheses”，但正文缺少清楚的逐项 CB—CJ 对照，CJ 单字调的对应关系仍待核实。": "Note: the opening paragraph says ‘CJ tones in parentheses’, but the text lacks a clear item-by-item CB–CJ comparison. The correspondence of CJ citation tones remains to be verified.",
  "：§1.3.4，第30页首段；与北部§1.3.1的编号系统区分": ": opening paragraph of §1.3.4, p. 30; distinct from the Northern numbering system in §1.3.1",
